      "message": "test(app): one temp folder for each wire_post program\n\npost_text() wrote every call to camcraft-wire-skims-<pid>.nc. The tests\nthat call it run in parallel threads of one process, so they shared the\npath, and Windows refused the write (\"Access is denied\", os error 5).\nEach call now writes into its own tempfile directory.\n\nFixes #4159\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
